OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh but largely dry and
OL,6,Fbright start to the day. Cloud will
OL,7,Fincrease, bringing showery outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain by the afternoon, some heavy
OL,9,Fand perhaps thundery. Feeling cooler
OL,10,Fwith temperatures near average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers will gradually ease
OL,13,Fthis evening, leading to a largely
OL,14,Fnight across the region. Clearer skies
OL,15,Fwill bring a chilly night, especially
OL,16,Fin rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
